@startuml Search file flow
title Search file flow

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Search Service" as Search
database "Search Index" as SearchIndex
participant "Metadata Service" as Metadata
database "Metadata DB" as MetadataDB
participant "Permission Service" as Permission
database "Permission DB" as PermissionDB

User -> App : Enter file name

App -> Gateway : GET /files/search?query={name}
Gateway -> Auth : Validate token
Auth --> Gateway : user_id

Gateway -> Search : Search files\nquery, user_id

Search -> SearchIndex : Find matching file_ids\nby query
SearchIndex --> Search : file_ids

Search -> Metadata : Get file metadata\nuser_id, file_ids
Metadata -> MetadataDB : Load metadata\nfor file_ids
MetadataDB --> Metadata : files metadata

Metadata -> Permission : Filter accessible files\nuser_id, file_ids
Permission -> PermissionDB : Check permissions
PermissionDB --> Permission : allowed file_ids
Permission --> Metadata : allowed file_ids

Metadata -> Metadata : Return accessible files
Metadata --> Search : accessible files metadata

Search -> Search : Sort results
Search --> Gateway : search results
Gateway --> App : search results

App --> User : Display files

@enduml